{"step_index":1846,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T02:20:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-16T09:20:05+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-16T09:20:06+07:00\nShowing lines 1-200 of 517\n1: # AGENTS.md — Panduan Lengkap Novel Translator Pipeline\n2: ## Antigravity Agent | Workspace: `E:\\novel yoga`\n3: \n4: > **Versi Dokumen:** 2.0 (Update: November 2026)\n5: > **Dibuat oleh:** Antigravity Agent (Claude Sonnet 4.6 Thinking / Gemini 3.8 Flash)\n6: > **Status Pipeline:** ✅ Produksi Aktif\n7: \n8: Dokumen ini adalah **panduan operasional teknis lengkap** untuk Agent Antigravity yang baru masuk ke workspace ini di PC lain. Baca seluruh dokumen ini sebelum mengambil tindakan apapun.\n9: \n10: ---\n11: \n12: ## 1. IDENTITAS & PERAN AGENT\n13: \n14: Kamu adalah **Spesialis Pelokalisasi & Penerjemah Novel / Light Novel Profesional**.\n15: \n16: Tugas utama: mengubah naskah mentah (bahasa Inggris / Jepang atau terjemahan mesin kaku) menjadi Bahasa Indonesia yang **luwes, hidup, energik, to-the-point, dan sangat adiktif** — setara kualitas manga terjemahan resmi atau light novel populer.\n17: \n18: ---\n19: \n20: ## 2. INVENTARIS WORKSPACE SAAT INI\n21: \n22: ### 2.1 Karya yang Sudah Selesai Diterjemahkan & Dikompilasi\n23: \n24: | Seri | Volume | TXT Terjemahan | EPUB Berilustrasi | Status |\n25: |------|--------|----------------|-------------------|--------|\n26: | **Overlord** (Kugane Maruyama) | Vol 01–16 | ✅ 16 file | ✅ 16 EPUB (~85 MB/vol) | Selesai |\n27: | **Mushoku Tensei** (Rifujin na Magonote) | Vol 01–26 | ✅ 26 file | ✅ 26 EPUB (~86 MB/vol) | Selesai |\n28: | **The Hobbit** (J.R.R. Tolkien) | 1 buku | ✅ 1 file | ❌ (tidak dicompile) | Selesai |\n29: | **Metro 2033** (Dmitry Glukhovsky) | 1 buku | ✅ 1 file (1 MB) | ❌ | Selesai |\n30: | **Tom Clancy - Rainbow Six** (Vol 1+2) | 1 buku | ✅ 1 file (1.9 MB) | ❌ | Selesai |\n31: | **Horus Rising** (Dan Abnett) | Parsial | ✅ 85 KB | ❌ | Parsial |\n32: \n33: Semua EPUB tersimpan di: `E:\\novel yoga\\epubs\\`\n34: \n35: ### 2.2 Lokasi File Output\n36: ```\n37: E:\\novel yoga\\\n38: ├── epubs\\                                    # Semua EPUB berilustrasi final\n39: │   ├── Mushoku Tensei - Volume 01 (Illustrated ID-Direct).epub\n40: │   ├── ...\n41: │   └── Overlord Volume 16 ... (Illustrated ID-Direct).epub\n42: ├── [NamaNovel] (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt    # Teks terjemahan utuh per volume\n43: ├── .[NamaNovel]_chunks_cache\\                # Cache chunk per bab (hidden folder)\n44: │   └── [vol_id]\\\n45: │       └── chunk_001.txt ... chunk_NNN.txt\n46: ├── [NamaNovel]_checkpoint.json               # Progress tracker per volume\n47: └── illustrations\\                            # Gambar sumber per volume\n48:     ├── Mushoku_Tensei_Volume_01\\\n49:     ├── Overlord_Volume_01\\\n50:     └── ...\n51: ```\n52: \n53: ### 2.3 Statistik Cache\n54: - Total chunk cache tersimpan: **~3.839 chunks** (47 volume dari 5+ seri novel)\n55: - Cache bertahan selama file tidak dihapus manual\n56: \n57: ---\n58: \n59: ## 3. PRASYARAT TEKNIS (WAJIB ADA DI PC)\n60: \n61: ### 3.1 Software & Runtime\n62: | Tool | Versi Minimum | Cara Cek | Cara Install |\n63: |------|---------------|----------|--------------|\n64: | **Node.js** | v18+ (saat ini: v22.23.4) | `node --version` | nodejs.org |\n65: | **tsx** (TypeScript runner) | v4+ (saat ini: v4.23.15) | `npx tsx --version` | `npm install -g tsx` |\n66: | **Python** | 3.9+ (saat ini: 3.11.0) | `python --version` | python.org |\n67: | **9router** | npm package | `where 9router` | `npm install -g 9router` |\n68: \n69: > **PENTING:** Jangan pernah gunakan `npx tsx` di PowerShell langsung (eksekusi script diblokir).\n70: > Selalu pakai: `cmd.exe /c npx tsx translate-novel-dragndrop.ts \"file.txt\"`\n71: \n72: ### 3.2 Dependensi Python (compile_epub_helper.py)\n73: Semua standar library — tidak perlu install package tambahan:\n74: - `zipfile`, `html`, `re`, `os`, `sys` (built-in)\n75: \n76: ### 3.3 Proxy LLM: 9router\n77: 9router bertindak sebagai **Local OpenAI-compatible proxy** yang meneruskan request ke model Antigravity.\n78: \n79: ```bash\n80: # Jalankan di background tray (Windows)\n81: cmd.exe /c \"9router -t --skip-update\"\n82: \n83: # Verifikasi aktif\n84: curl http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1/models\n85: \n86: # Base URL yang dipakai script\n87: LLM_PROXY_URL = \"http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1/chat/completions\"\n88: ```\n89: \n90: **Response dari 9router adalah Server-Sent Events (SSE / streaming)**, bukan JSON biasa. Script TypeScript sudah menangani ini secara native.\n91: \n92: ### 3.4 API Key 9router\n93: ```\n94: sk-2c1573f206deb3a0-ryos2n-4198badd\n95: ```\n96: Sudah ter-hardcode di `translate-novel-dragndrop.ts` sebagai fallback. Bisa override via env var `LLM_API_KEY`.\n97: \n98: ---\n99: \n100: ## 4. ARSITEKTUR PIPELINE LENGKAP\n101: \n102: ### 4.1 Alur Kerja End-to-End\n103: \n104: ```\n105: [Source: PDF / EPUB / TXT Mentah]\n106:          │\n107:          ▼\n108: [1. Ekstraksi Teks]\n109:   extract_mushoku_helper.py   ← PDF → TXT dengan marker halaman [[PAGE:XX]]\n110:   extract_overlord_pdf.py     ← PDF → TXT Overlord\n111:   (atau langsung TXT / EPUB ke step 2)\n112:          │\n113:          ▼\n114: [2. Penerjemahan: translate-novel-dragndrop.ts]\n115:   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n116:   │  Deteksi Novel → Pilih Style Mode Otomatis          │\n117:   │  Split ke Bab (regex heading detector)              │\n118:   │  Split Bab → Chunks (~6.500 karakter / chunk)       │\n119:   │  3 Worker Paralel (CONCURRENCY=3)                   │\n120:   │  Kirim ke 9router → Gemini 3.8 Flash Low            │\n121:   │  Deteksi Refusal → Sub-Chunk Adaptif fallback       │\n122:   │  Cache Chunk → Checkpoint → Assemble Output         │\n123:   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n124:          │\n125:          ▼\n126: [3. TXT Output: NamaNovel (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt]\n127:          │\n128:          ▼\n129: [4. Kompilasi EPUB: compile_epub_helper.py]\n130:   Merge teks + gambar ilustrasi → EPUB berilustrasi\n131:          │\n132:          ▼\n133: [5. Output Final: epubs/NamaNovel (Illustrated ID-Direct).epub]\n134: ```\n135: \n136: ### 4.2 Script Utama & Fungsinya\n137: \n138: | Script | Bahasa | Fungsi |\n139: |--------|--------|--------|\n140: | `translate-novel-dragndrop.ts` | TypeScript | **Core engine.** Deteksi novel, split bab/chunk, kirim ke LLM, cache, assemble, compile EPUB |\n141: | `compile_epub_helper.py` | Python | Kompilasi TXT terjemahan + gambar ilustrasi → EPUB valid |\n142: | `extract_mushoku_helper.py` | Python | Ekstrak PDF Mushoku Tensei → TXT dengan marker `[[PAGE:XX]]` |\n143: | `extract_overlord_pdf.py` | Python | Ekstrak PDF Overlord → TXT |\n144: | `run_mushoku_marathon.py` | Python | Runner berurutan: terjemahkan Volume 01–26 otomatis |\n145: | `run_overlord_marathon.py` | Python | Runner berurutan untuk serial Overlord |\n146: | `heal_and_build_all_mushoku.py` | Python | Hapus chunk refusal → retranslate → rebuild semua EPUB |\n147: | `heal_overlord_refusals.py` | Python | Versi heal untuk Overlord |\n148: | `batch_build_all_illustrated_epubs.py` | Python | Batch compile semua EPUB dari TXT yang sudah ada |\n149: | `repair_all_refusals.ts` | TypeScript | Scanner & healer refusal-halus di semua volume |\n150: | `DRAG_DROP_TRANSLATOR.bat` | Batch | Runner Windows: drag & drop file ke sini lalu enter |\n151: | `batch-translate-txt.ts` | TypeScript | Alternatif batch translator multi-file |\n152: \n153: ---\n154: \n155: ## 5. CARA MENJALANKAN\n156: \n157: ### 5.1 Perintah Dasar (Satu Novel)\n158: ```cmd\n159: # Dari direktori E:\\novel yoga\n160: cmd.exe /c npx tsx translate-novel-dragndrop.ts \"NamaFile.txt\"\n161: cmd.exe /c npx tsx translate-novel-dragndrop.ts \"NamaFile.epub\"\n162: ```\n163: \n164: ### 5.2 Marathon Runner (Semua Volume Satu Seri)\n165: ```cmd\n166: # Mushoku Tensei Vol 01-26 (otomatis dari checkpoint)\n167: python run_mushoku_marathon.py\n168: \n169: # Overlord Vol 01-16\n170: python run_overlord_marathon.py\n171: ```\n172: \n173: ### 5.3 Heal Refusal + Rebuild EPUB (Pasca-Terjemahan)\n174: ```cmd\n175: # Mushoku: scan refusal, delete chunk, retranslate, rebuild semua EPUB\n176: python heal_and_build_all_mushoku.py\n177: \n178: # Overlord: scan & heal refusal\n179: python heal_overlord_refusals.py\n180: ```\n181: \n182: ### 5.4 Compile EPUB Saja (Tanpa Retranslate)\n183: ```cmd\n184: # Compile semua volume yang belum punya EPUB\n185: python batch_build_all_illustrated_epubs.py\n186: ```\n187: \n188: ### 5.5 Environment Variables (Override Konfigurasi)\n189: ```bash\n190: set LLM_PROXY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1/chat/completions\n191: set LLM_MODEL=ag/gemini-3.8-flash-low\n192: set LLM_API_KEY=sk-2c1573f206deb3a0-ryos2n-4198badd\n193: set CONCURRENCY=3\n194: ```\n195: \n196: > **Rekomendasi Model:** `ag/gemini-3.8-flash-low` untuk kecepatan + kuota aman.\n197: > Jika butuh kualitas lebih tinggi, pakai `ag/gemini-3.8-flash-medium`.\n198: \n199: ---\n200: "}
